 SG_ E2E_CRC : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" RT_CORE,LINUX
 SG_ E2E_COUNTER : 8|4@1+ (1,0) [0|15] "" RT_CORE,LINUX
 SG_ NODE_MODE : 12|4@1+ (1,0) [0|15] "" RT_CORE,LINUX
 SG_ ERROR_COUNT : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" RT_CORE,LINUX
 SG_ UPTIME : 24|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "s" RT_CORE,LINUX

